			<item>
				<title>Just keep on &#34;Save for later&#34;</title>
				<link>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/just-keep-on-save-for-later/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2020 10:50:00 +0000</pubDate><author>andreffs18@gmail.com (André Silva)</author>
				<guid>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/just-keep-on-save-for-later/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Since this &lt;em&gt;#remotelife&lt;/em&gt; began, sadly not for the best reasons, I&amp;rsquo;ve been able to finally clean my backlog of, guess what, TV Shows, Games, Podcasts, Books&amp;hellip; Well, everything that a person is suppose to do!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Very happy was I until I remembered that, maybe I should start looking into the &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;To Read&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; bookmarks, &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Saved&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; on Reddit and, the holy grail, &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Read Later&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; of Feedly.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;bookmarks.png&#34; alt=&#34;All bookmarks&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;While the &amp;ldquo;Saved&amp;rdquo; section on Reddit was mostly threads from &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.reddit.com/r/cscareerquestions/&#34;&gt;/r/cscarrearquestions&lt;/a&gt; (and some memes from &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.reddit.com/r/wallstreetbets&#34;&gt;/r/wsb&lt;/a&gt; 😂) the other two places were actual interesting articles that I have planned on reading.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Learning How to Canary Deploy with Kubernetes</title>
				<link>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/learning-how-to-canary-deploy-with-kubernetes/</link>
				<pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2020 09:05:00 +0000</pubDate><author>andreffs18@gmail.com (André Silva)</author>
				<guid>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/learning-how-to-canary-deploy-with-kubernetes/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;header.png&#34; alt=&#34;Header Image&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Its true, that if the time from developing a feature to deploying it to your customers only takes minutes to hours instead of days to months, that you probably have a pretty amazing development workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Im also willing to bet that a key feature of that workflow is an impeccable CI/CD pipeline, that not only allows your development team to automate a lot of time consuming and manual tasks (like building, testing, deploying, etc) but also, shortens the feedback cycle between developing-&amp;gt;testing and testing-&amp;gt;production.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>SEO Tips</title>
				<link>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/seo-tips/</link>
				<pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2017 00:45:32 +0000</pubDate><author>andreffs18@gmail.com (André Silva)</author>
				<guid>https://www.andreffs.com/blog/seo-tips/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;My key takeaways from making this website &amp;ldquo;SEO friendly&amp;rdquo;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Use link &amp;ldquo;tree structure&amp;rdquo; from homepage. This way, bots and crawlers can find every page on the website&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Good &lt;strong&gt;titles&lt;/strong&gt;, under 65 characters&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Meta tags with good keywords under 100 characters&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Use canonical urls on every page&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;table style=&#34;border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#34;vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f&#34;&gt;1&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f&#34;&gt;2&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f&#34;&gt;3&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;&lt;td style=&#34;vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;canonical&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/seo-tips/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;!-- instead of --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;canonical&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/blog/seo-tips&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol start=&#34;5&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Add &amp;ldquo;alt&amp;rdquo; tag to images&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;table style=&#34;border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#34;vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f&#34;&gt;1&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;&lt;td style=&#34;vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;img&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;alt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;About me picture&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/images/about.jpeg&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;pre-commit-hooks&#34;&gt;Pre-commit hooks&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Having this checklist is nice but it would be better if I didn&amp;rsquo;t have to check this by myself every time I do a side project.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
